# Expedia: cheapest after search

`plugin.expedia results` only reads the list. It does not change **Sort by**.

After every `search`, wait for the results page, then `plugin.expedia sort cheapest`, then `results`. That is the default. Expedia often ignores the cheap-price URL and shows Recommended until you `sort`.

Only `sort earliest` / `duration` / etc. when the user asked for that order. Then `results` again.

For a time-of-day window, `leave morning` / `evening` / etc., then `results`. That filters; it does not reorder.
